abstract: >-
  Future AGI is an open-source end‑to‑end platform for building, evaluating,
  observing, and improving AI agents. It provides simulation, 50+ evaluation metrics,
  built‑in guardrails, OpenTelemetry tracing, an OpenAI‑compatible gateway,
  and prompt optimization algorithms—all in a self‑hostable package.
